## Messages

```json5 theme={"theme":{"light":"min-light","dark":"min-dark"}}
{
  messages: {
    responsePrefix: "🦞", // or "auto"
    ackReaction: "👀",
    ackReactionScope: "group-mentions", // group-mentions | group-all | direct | all
    removeAckAfterReply: false,
